  "description": "WELCOME HOME<br/>Positioned in a convenient Victoria Park pocket, this well-presented two-bedroom residence offers comfortable, low-maintenance living close to cafés, restaurants, shopping, public transport and everyday amenities. With a spacious open-plan living and meals area, stylish kitchen, small rear courtyard and access to a swimming pool, the home is ideal for tenants seeking a practical lifestyle in one of Perth's most popular inner-city suburbs.<br/><br/>Enjoy the ease of living close to the Albany Highway lifestyle precinct, local dining, parklands, transport links and the Perth CBD, with the added benefit of water usage included.<br/><br/>WHY YOU'LL LOVE LIVING HERE<br/>/ Two generous sized bedrooms with practical storage.<br/>/ Master bedroom with walk-in wardrobe and direct entrance to the bathroom.<br/>/ Second bedroom with built-in wardrobe.<br/>/ Roller blind to the main bedroom window.<br/>/ Stylish kitchen with electric cooking and plenty of storage.<br/>/ Laundry alcove conveniently positioned off the kitchen.<br/>/ Large open-plan living and meals area.<br/>/ Security screens to the front windows and door.<br/>/ Small rear courtyard for easy outdoor living.<br/>/ Swimming pool available to enjoy.<br/>/ Undercover parking for one car.<br/>/ Water usage included for added convenience.<br/><br/>THE NEIGHBOURHOOD<br/>Victoria Park is loved for its vibrant café and dining scene, excellent public transport connections and close proximity to the Perth CBD. Enjoy easy access to Albany Highway, local shops, restaurants, bars, parks, schools and nearby riverfront spaces, making this a convenient and lifestyle-focused location.<br/><br/>THE OPPORTUNITY<br/>A practical and well-located rental offering easy-care living, comfortable interiors, pool access and a small rear courtyard in a popular Victoria Park setting. Ideal for tenants seeking convenience, lifestyle and excellent access to local amenities, transport and the Perth CBD. Register your interest today to arrange a viewing.<br/><br/>IMPORTANT INFORMATION<br/>/ Unfurnished. One or more images in this listing may include staging furniture, digital enhancements or virtual styling for advertising purposes. The property's actual condition, features, dimensions and finishes may differ from what is shown and should be confirmed at inspection.<br/>/ Initial lease term of 12 months preferred.<br/>/ Available 20 July 2026.<br/>/ Appliances included: Electric cooktop.<br/>/ Parking: Undercover parking for one car.<br/>/ Courtyard: Small rear courtyard.<br/>/ Complex facilities: Swimming pool available for tenant use.<br/>/ Water usage: Included.<br/>/ Utilities: Tenants are responsible for connecting all other utilities.<br/>/ Applications: Apply via edisonproperty.com.au. Applications will not be assessed until after a scheduled home open. Applicants must view the property at a scheduled home open or private inspection before an application will be processed. Register to inspect via the listing to receive inspection details and notifications.<br/><br/>For further information please contact Lauren Smith 0433 533 391.<br/><br/>LANDLORD / INVESTOR ENQUIRIES<br/>Are you a current landlord or a new investor? To learn more about Edison Property's property management services, please contact our Team Lead, Jules Blackwell, at pm1@edisonproperty.com.au or call 0451 162 220.",
